[{"text": "The assembly will hear an address by His", "start": 2.08, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "Excellency Joseph Eny Yuma Boakai,", "start": 5.12, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "President of the Republic of Liberia.", "start": 8.8, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "I request protocol to escort his", "start": 13.36, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "excellency", "start": 15.519, "duration": 6.84}, {"text": "and invite him to address the assembly.", "start": 17.6, "duration": 4.759}, {"text": ">> [applause]", "start": 25.545, "duration": 2.02}, {"text": "[applause]", "start": 32.095, "duration": 2.675}, {"text": "[cheering]", "start": 32.75, "duration": 2.02}, {"text": ">> Mr. President,", "start": 45.12, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "Mr. Secretary General,", "start": 47.6, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "excellencies,", "start": 50.559, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "distinguished delegates,", "start": 52.64, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "on behalf of the government and the", "start": 56.16, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "people of Liberia,", "start": 58.239, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "I congratulate your excellency,", "start": 60.48, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "Kalo Radman,", "start": 64.64, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "on your election as president of the", "start": 67.119, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "81st session of the General Assembly", "start": 69.2, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "and I assure you of Liberia full", "start": 73.76, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "support.", "start": 76.64, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "We also thank our excellency", "start": 78.32, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "and Lina Book for her leadership", "start": 81.2, "duration": 10.4}, {"text": "during the 80 80th session.", "start": 86.32, "duration": 7.839}, {"text": "As Secretary General Antonio Gutier is", "start": 91.6, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "prepared to conclude his tenure,", "start": 94.159, "duration": 8.561}, {"text": "Liberia salutes his principal leadership", "start": 98.96, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "and tireless commitment to reform. Mr.", "start": 102.72, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "President, the theme of this session,", "start": 106.32, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "restoring trust,", "start": 110.56, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "managing transformation,", "start": 112.88, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "a united nation that delivers for all,", "start": 115.28, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "frames in our view", "start": 119.52, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "a lingering crisis of legitimacy", "start": 122.24, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "and relevant", "start": 125.84, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "that demands urgent attention.", "start": 127.6, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "Trust immortalism", "start": 131.599, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "is broken", "start": 134.16, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "and needs to be restored.", "start": 136.0, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "Not because the principles of charter", "start": 138.72, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "are no longer relevant, but because we", "start": 141.599, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "have applied them inconsistently", "start": 145.68, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "and selectively", "start": 149.12, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "fearing global fragmentation.", "start": 151.04, "duration": 8.559}, {"text": "Our answer to that modularity", "start": 154.239, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "is", "start": 159.599, "duration": 3.521}, {"text": "a better", "start": 161.2, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "multilarism.", "start": 163.12, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "80 years ago, Liberia was among the only", "start": 165.44, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "four nations to sign the charter", "start": 168.319, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "establishing the United Nation.", "start": 171.04, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "Believing then, as we do now, that a", "start": 173.84, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "peaceful world rests on international", "start": 177.2, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "law, respect", "start": 180.72, "duration": 7.439}, {"text": "for human rights and dignity, a", "start": 184.159, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "commitment to development.", "start": 188.159, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Having risen from the ashes of conflict", "start": 190.72, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "to become resilient democracy,", "start": 193.599, "duration": 7.761}, {"text": "Liberia is living proof that dialogue", "start": 197.2, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "can overcome division", "start": 201.36, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "that institution can be built.", "start": 204.48, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "This same spirit defines our national", "start": 207.68, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "governance today.", "start": 211.519, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "Under my administration,", "start": 214.159, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Liberia is strengthening public", "start": 217.44, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "accountability,", "start": 220.159, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "ensuring prudent financial management,", "start": 222.239, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "intensify the fight against corruption,", "start": 225.36, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "and supporting the judiciary in", "start": 229.76, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "rebuilding citizens confidence in the", "start": 232.879, "duration": 8.161}, {"text": "institutions that serve them.", "start": 236.319, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "Mr. President, without peace,", "start": 241.04, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "development is impossible.", "start": 243.84, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "And without inclusive development, peace", "start": 246.239, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "is an illusion.", "start": 248.799, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "Across the raging theater of conflict,", "start": 251.12, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "innocent civilians continue to pay the", "start": 253.68, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "unacceptable pe price of war.", "start": 256.88, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "We renew our call for an immediate end", "start": 261.12, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "to all hostilities,", "start": 264.96, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "unhindered humanitarian access, and full", "start": 267.36, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "respect for international humanitarian", "start": 270.8, "duration": 6.2}, {"text": "law.", "start": 274.0, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Prevention must be at the heart of", "start": 278.96, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "international peace and security.", "start": 281.12, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "Investing in preventive democracy,", "start": 285.52, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "mediation and early warning is not only", "start": 289.28, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "morally imperative", "start": 293.04, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "but also physically prudent. The cause", "start": 295.44, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "of preventing war plays", "start": 298.72, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "comprising the cause of", "start": 303.04, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "building broken society.", "start": 306.32, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "As a current member of the United", "start": 310.96, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "Nations Security Council,", "start": 312.72, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "Liberia is putting these principles into", "start": 315.199, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "practice", "start": 317.68, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "while confronting evolving threats", "start": 319.6, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "across West Africa,", "start": 322.4, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "including", "start": 324.88, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "transnational organized crime, cyber", "start": 327.52, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "war, and illicit according trafficking", "start": 330.88, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "along the maritime corridors in the Gulf", "start": 334.72, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "of Guinea.", "start": 338.32, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "Through our joint security forces,", "start": 340.639, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "we are tightening", "start": 344.0, "duration": 7.8}, {"text": "the vice on transnational drug cartels.", "start": 346.16, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "No nation can police global criminal", "start": 354.16, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "network alone.", "start": 357.44, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "So we call on international partners", "start": 359.44, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "for targeted support in coastg guard", "start": 362.8, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "surveillance", "start": 366.72, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "intelligence sharing", "start": 368.319, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "and put security technologies", "start": 371.039, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "sustainable development and reforming", "start": 374.96, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "the international financial system.", "start": 377.6, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 381.12, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "as we enter the home stretch of the 2030", "start": 383.12, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "agenda,", "start": 386.72, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "developing nations are being squeezed by", "start": 389.68, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "unsustainable debt, shrinking financial", "start": 392.56, "duration": 8.639}, {"text": "space, and mounting external shocks.", "start": 396.08, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "At a core, this is a crisis of", "start": 401.199, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "international financial system designed", "start": 404.08, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "for a different era.", "start": 407.44, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "Liberia calls for urgent structural", "start": 410.16, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "reform of the international financial", "start": 413.52, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "architecture.", "start": 415.84, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "Developing nation need concessional", "start": 417.84, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "financing", "start": 420.4, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "depth sustainability", "start": 421.919, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "and predictable development capital not", "start": 424.479, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "escalating interest rates that threaten", "start": 427.84, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "survival.", "start": 430.8, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "At the heart of this reform must be a", "start": 432.639, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "fairer voice and a vote for developing", "start": 435.199, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "countries within the Breton Woo", "start": 438.639, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "institution, the World Bank and the", "start": 441.36, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "International Monetary Fund whose", "start": 443.919, "duration": 8.4}, {"text": "governance reflect the word of 1945", "start": 446.96, "duration": 8.4}, {"text": "rather than the word of today.", "start": 452.319, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "A financial system that decides", "start": 455.36, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "the fate of billions cannot continue to", "start": 459.039, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "be governed by a few.", "start": 462.319, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Reform", "start": 465.52, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "of our international financial system is", "start": 467.599, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "not a technical exercise.", "start": 470.639, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "It is a precondition for delivering the", "start": 473.759, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "sustainable development goals and for", "start": 477.36, "duration": 7.119}, {"text": "restoring the very trust this assembly", "start": 480.08, "duration": 8.44}, {"text": "is meeting to discuss", "start": 484.479, "duration": 4.041}, {"text": "at a home. My government is driving", "start": 490.479, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "transformation through our national", "start": 494.0, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "development blueprint. The arrest agenda", "start": 496.16, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "for inclusive development which f", "start": 500.16, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "focuses on agriculture,", "start": 504.0, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "rules, rule of law, education,", "start": 506.4, "duration": 5.999}, {"text": "sanitation and tourism.", "start": 509.44, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "This year we have made concrete strides", "start": 512.399, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "in revenue administration and", "start": 514.959, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "infrastructure", "start": 517.2, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "including rural roads linking farm to", "start": 518.959, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "market. Liberia contributes virtually", "start": 522.08, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "nothing to global emission. Yet our", "start": 526.0, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "communities face coastal erosion,", "start": 530.24, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "flooding and disrupted agricultural", "start": 533.92, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "cycles.", "start": 537.44, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "My country also harbored 42%", "start": 538.959, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "of the remaining upper guinea", "start": 543.76, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "rainforest, a vital global carbon s that", "start": 546.48, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "we maintain on behalf of all humanity.", "start": 550.72, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "Climate responsibility must be paired", "start": 554.72, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "with climate justice.", "start": 559.04, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "We call on industrial nations to honor", "start": 562.16, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "their financial pledges", "start": 564.72, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "and", "start": 567.2, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "operationalize", "start": 568.88, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "laws and damage mechanisms.", "start": 570.56, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "Democracy and human rights", "start": 574.48, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "and responsible innovation. Mr.", "start": 577.519, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "President, the ultimate ultimate measure", "start": 580.32, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "of governance is inclusion.", "start": 583.519, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "In Africa, 60% of our population is", "start": 586.48, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "under 25.", "start": 589.92, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "the single greatest engine of innovation", "start": 591.839, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "on earth.", "start": 594.88, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "We must equip our youth with STEM", "start": 596.8, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "education,", "start": 599.2, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "digital literacy, and technical training", "start": 600.88, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "so they become co-creators in the global", "start": 604.88, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "digital economy,", "start": 608.64, "duration": 5.8}, {"text": "not just consumers.", "start": 610.8, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "Gender equality remains essential.", "start": 617.839, "duration": 7.601}, {"text": "When women lead, peace agreements last", "start": 621.6, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "longer, economies grow faster, and", "start": 625.44, "duration": 8.399}, {"text": "governance becomes more accountable.", "start": 629.44, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "Liber", "start": 633.839, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "Liberia remains committed to full", "start": 636.24, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "political, economic, and social equality", "start": 638.88, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "of women and girls.", "start": 642.16, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "Liberia welcomes global effort to govern", "start": 645.12, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "new technologies", "start": 649.68, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "including the secretary general's", "start": 651.68, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "independent international scientific", "start": 654.16, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "panel on artificial intelligence.", "start": 656.56, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "Developing nation must not be left", "start": 661.04, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "behind as mere consumers", "start": 663.279, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "or algorithms designed elsewhere.", "start": 667.279, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "We must be supported in building true", "start": 671.519, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "digital sovereignty.", "start": 674.399, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "We join cause abinding", "start": 677.12, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "ethical norms and greater regulation", "start": 680.079, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "of artificial intelligence", "start": 683.36, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "particularly in warfare.", "start": 686.16, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "Innovation must protect human", "start": 688.959, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "development", "start": 691.279, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "not automate human destruction.", "start": 692.88, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "reforming global governance,", "start": 696.88, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "correcting historic injustice.", "start": 700.399, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "Mr. President, 80 years of patient is", "start": 703.36, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "enough. The time for structural reform", "start": 706.8, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "is now.", "start": 710.079, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "While we welcome the UN80 reform agenda", "start": 712.16, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "to make this organization agile", "start": 715.36, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "efficient and accountable", "start": 719.04, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "through reform must address a core", "start": 722.0, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "structural issue. The UN security", "start": 725.68, "duration": 8.959}, {"text": "council article is home to 1.5 billion", "start": 729.12, "duration": 9.12}, {"text": "people and account for nearly onethird", "start": 734.639, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "of the UN membership.", "start": 738.24, "duration": 7.8}, {"text": "Yet 80%", "start": 742.079, "duration": 3.961}, {"text": "80% of security council", "start": 746.079, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "mandates concern Africa peace and", "start": 749.44, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "security.", "start": 752.88, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "Why Africa remains", "start": 754.48, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "without a single permanency", "start": 757.04, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "on the Oregon responsible for global", "start": 760.32, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "peace.", "start": 763.279, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "This historical injustice is no longer", "start": 764.8, "duration": 6.279}, {"text": "tenable.", "start": 768.079, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Liberia reaffirms its support for common", "start": 775.76, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "African position on proposed reform of", "start": 780.32, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "the United Nations Security Council.", "start": 783.92, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "We celebrate the presentation of the", "start": 787.2, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "African motor during the recent", "start": 790.72, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "intergovernmental negotiation", "start": 793.76, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "which advances", "start": 796.959, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "us toward textbased negotiation.", "start": 799.36, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "Africa demands no fewer than two", "start": 802.959, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "permanent seats with all accompanying", "start": 806.48, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "rights and responsibilities", "start": 809.92, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "including the veto.", "start": 813.36, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "So long as it exists as well as", "start": 816.32, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "additional non-permanent seat correcting", "start": 819.68, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "the imbalance is no not a favor for", "start": 823.279, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "Africa. It is necessary to restore", "start": 826.88, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "United Nation trust credibility and", "start": 830.56, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "legitimacy.", "start": 833.44, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 838.72, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "the choices before the 81st general", "start": 841.76, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "assembly is stuck.", "start": 844.72, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "We can allow multilateralism to drift", "start": 847.44, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "towards irrelevance", "start": 850.399, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "or we can change course and act boldly", "start": 853.12, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "to restore trust,", "start": 857.6, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "credibility and legitimacy.", "start": 860.24, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "Liberia's journey for civil conflict to", "start": 863.279, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "constitutional democracy", "start": 867.04, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "and from broken institutions to", "start": 869.6, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "accountable governance", "start": 871.68, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "shows what is possible when nations", "start": 873.839, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "commit", "start": 877.279, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "deliberately and consistently", "start": 878.88, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "to restoring trust and managing", "start": 881.92, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "transformation", "start": 884.24, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "as we did in San Francisco in 1945.", "start": 887.44, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "Liberia is ready together with all", "start": 891.68, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "member states to save mankind from the", "start": 894.72, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "scourge of war,", "start": 897.68, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "guarantee human dignity", "start": 900.32, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "and leave no one behind.", "start": 902.88, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "Let us leave this assembly committed to", "start": 905.839, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "a united nation", "start": 909.12, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "that is not deliberate on crisis but", "start": 911.6, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "also resolve them and restore trust", "start": 915.199, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "through results.", "start": 919.36, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "protects the vulnerable,", "start": 921.279, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "honor the right of our nation, and", "start": 923.68, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "secure a peaceful planet for generations", "start": 926.32, "duration": 8.44}, {"text": "to come. Thank you.", "start": 930.16, "duration": 4.6}, {"text": "On behalf of the assembly,", "start": 943.36, "duration": 4.12}, {"text": "On behalf of the assembly, I wish to", "start": 951.68, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "thank the president of the Republic of", "start": 954.0, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "Liberia.", "start": 956.24, "duration": 3.0}]